{
  "source": "videos/data-centers.mp4",
  "duration": 148.02725,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.86,
      "text": "When you type a prompt into an AI chatbot, the answer feels instant and weightless,"
    },
    {
      "start": 5.3,
      "end": 8.32,
      "text": "but the software is anchored in massive physical reality."
    },
    {
      "start": 8.82,
      "end": 13.98,
      "text": "Generating a single 2,000-word chat requires roughly two quadrillion calculations."
    },
    {
      "start": 14.68,
      "end": 18.78,
      "text": "Training a new model from scratch takes that number up to about 100 septillion."
    },
    {
      "start": 19.38,
      "end": 24.3,
      "text": "The industry calls the ability to process all that math, compute, and it relies entirely"
    },
    {
      "start": 24.3,
      "end": 25.44,
      "text": "on tangible hardware."
    },
    {
      "start": 26.2,
      "end": 28.46,
      "text": "These facilities are the size of large warehouses."
    },
    {
      "start": 28.46,
      "end": 33.84,
      "text": "They are packed end-to-end with specialized GPUs, high-speed networks, and industrial"
    },
    {
      "start": 33.84,
      "end": 36.3,
      "text": "power and cooling systems running around the clock."
    },
    {
      "start": 36.96,
      "end": 41.7,
      "text": "Every time you press send, you are waking up heavy machinery somewhere in the world to answer you."
    },
    {
      "start": 42.1,
      "end": 44.98,
      "text": "Building one of these complexes requires enormous capital."
    },
    {
      "start": 45.68,
      "end": 49.02,
      "text": "They span several football fields and draw the electricity of a small city."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.6,
      "end": 52.0,
      "text": "Ultimately, somebody has to pay for all of that arithmetic."
    },
    {
      "start": 52.9,
      "end": 56.4,
      "text": "This infographic breaks down the footprint of these facilities into four parts."
    },
    {
      "start": 56.96,
      "end": 61.96,
      "text": "Looking at electricity, massive amounts of power are required just to run the processors."
    },
    {
      "start": 62.74,
      "end": 68.02,
      "text": "Because those chips run extremely hot, data centers evaporate millions of gallons of water"
    },
    {
      "start": 68.02,
      "end": 70.46,
      "text": "on a hot day just to keep the equipment cool."
    },
    {
      "start": 71.22,
      "end": 75.68,
      "text": "All of those heavy cooling fans and mechanical systems create a constant hum,"
    },
    {
      "start": 76.04,
      "end": 80.18,
      "text": "24 hours a day, and despite the massive size and construction effort,"
    },
    {
      "start": 80.58,
      "end": 84.62,
      "text": "a finished facility might employ only one to two hundred permanent workers."
    },
    {
      "start": 85.22,
      "end": 92.3,
      "text": "To put this in perspective, data centers consumed about 4.4 percent of all U.S. electricity in 2023."
    },
    {
      "start": 93.0,
      "end": 98.56,
      "text": "The Berkeley lab projects that usage will grow to between 6.7 and 12 percent by 2028."
    },
    {
      "start": 99.14,
      "end": 103.0,
      "text": "However, these projections represent the total draw of all data centers,"
    },
    {
      "start": 103.44,
      "end": 105.14,
      "text": "not artificial intelligence alone."
    },
    {
      "start": 106.02,
      "end": 111.02,
      "text": "How do operators actually shrink this massive growing footprint when demand is so intense?"
    },
    {
      "start": 111.48,
      "end": 116.82,
      "text": "One approach is deploying new technology, like designing more efficient chips or implementing"
    },
    {
      "start": 116.82,
      "end": 120.9,
      "text": "closed-loop cooling systems that recycle water instead of evaporating it."
    },
    {
      "start": 121.44,
      "end": 124.1,
      "text": "But efficiency alone cannot outpace the demand."
    },
    {
      "start": 124.7,
      "end": 129.28,
      "text": "Operators are having to seek out massive new power agreements just to keep the hardware fed."
    },
    {
      "start": 129.88,
      "end": 131.86,
      "text": "The scale of these energy needs is immense."
    },
    {
      "start": 132.62,
      "end": 136.92,
      "text": "Microsoft recently signed an agreement with Constellation Energy that will support the proposed"
    },
    {
      "start": 136.92,
      "end": 139.9,
      "text": "restart of the Three Mile Island Unit 1 nuclear plant."
    },
    {
      "start": 140.72,
      "end": 144.38,
      "text": "Every AI chat costs something real. Now you know what's behind the magic."
    }
  ],
